  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "kqmdp4i2r6Oimzuwpu29A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 255.6210833894968,
      "y": 142.20244140625,
      "width": 693.75,
      "height": 710.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1550739825,
      "version": 1378,
      "versionNonce": 250040945,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1721635226097,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Proximity service:\n\n- User can select radius from 0.5km, 1km, 2km, 5km, 10km, 20km\n- Return businesses within the radius selected and user's current location\n- Businesses can do CRUD ops will be available to user after 24 hrs\n\n- Low latency\n- Data privacy\n- Highly available & scalable\n\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n- 1 day => approx. 10^5 seconds\n- User makes 5 queries per day\n=> (100 million users * 5)/10^5 = 5000 qps\n\n\nAPI:\n\n1. GET api for getting businesses in given radius\n\nGET /v1/search/nearby\n\ninput: Double radius, Double latitude, Double longitude\noutput: List<Business> businessList, Long pageSize, Long pageNumber\n\n\n2. POST apis for CRUD on businesses\n\nGET /v1/business/:id -> get a particular business \nPUT /v1/business/:id -> update a particular business\nPOST /v1/business -> create a business(es)\nDELETE /v1/business/:id -> delete a business\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Proximity service:\n\n- User can select radius from 0.5km, 1km, 2km, 5km, 10km, 20km\n- Return businesses within the radius selected and user's current location\n- Businesses can do CRUD ops will be available to user after 24 hrs\n\n- Low latency\n- Data privacy\n- Highly available & scalable\n\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n- 1 day => approx. 10^5 seconds\n- User makes 5 queries per day\n=> (100 million users * 5)/10^5 = 5000 qps\n\n\nAPI:\n\n1. GET api for getting businesses in given radius\n\nGET /v1/search/nearby\n\ninput: Double radius, Double latitude, Double longitude\noutput: List<Business> businessList, Long pageSize, Long pageNumber\n\n\n2. POST apis for CRUD on businesses\n\nGET /v1/business/:id -> get a particular business \nPUT /v1/business/:id -> update a particular business\nPOST /v1/business -> create a business(es)\nDELETE /v1/business/:id -> delete a business\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
